          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.083,
            0.721,
            0.109
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "11.2 Does Light Travel in a Straight Line?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.126,
            0.485,
            0.144
          ],
          "content": "Let us do an activity to try to find out."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.155,
            0.452,
            0.174
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Activity 11.1: Let us investigate"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.19,
            0.602,
            0.244
          ],
          "content": "Take three matchboxes and make a hole in the inner tray of each matchbox, exactly at the same position."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.246,
            0.602,
            0.318
          ],
          "content": "Arrange these three matchboxes in a straight line. Make sure that all three holes are exactly at the same height and are in a line as shown in Fig. 11.4."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.609,
            0.135,
            0.888,
            0.281
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.638,
                0.285,
                0.862,
                0.316
              ],
              "content": "Fig. 11.4: Matchbox activity— light through holes"
            }
          ],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_2_image_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.32,
            0.727,
            0.357
          ],
          "content": "Place a torch light on one side of the matchboxes, ensuring that its lamp is at the height of the holes."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.359,
            0.727,
            0.413
          ],
          "content": "Place a cardboard (screen) on the other side of the matchboxes and obtain a bright spot on it. (You may need to slightly adjust the heights of boxes.)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.414,
            0.728,
            0.452
          ],
          "content": "Move one of the matchboxes slightly to a side or up and down. Are you able to obtain the light spot on the screen now?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.141,
            0.453,
            0.727,
            0.509
          ],
          "content": "When all the three holes are not in the same line, we could not obtain the light spot on the screen. These observations suggest that light travels in a straight line."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.517,
            0.45,
            0.616
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_2_image_13.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.495,
            0.537,
            0.703,
            0.591
          ],
          "content": "I have an idea. Let us try to see the candle flame through a bent pipe!"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.729,
            0.521,
            0.827,
            0.626
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_2_image_15.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.639,
            0.44,
            0.659
          ],
          "content": "Should we also try out this idea?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.668,
            0.42,
            0.688
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Activity 11.2: Let us explore"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.106,
            0.703,
            0.143,
            0.731
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_2_image_18.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.142,
            0.704,
            0.613,
            0.739
          ],
          "content": "**Caution** — Use a lighted candle under adult supervision only."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.644,
            0.635,
            0.859,
            0.74
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_2_image_20.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.743,
            0.613,
            0.799
          ],
          "content": "Take a long hollow pipe of some flexible material and align it so that you can see the candle flame as shown in Fig. 11.5a."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.803,
            0.613,
            0.841
          ],
          "content": "Now, bend the pipe and try to see the candle flame again (Fig. 11.5b). Can you still see it?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.14,
            0.844,
            0.613,
            0.9
          ],
          "content": "You could see the candle flame through a straight pipe but not through a bent pipe. This shows that light travels in a straight line. Fi"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.642,
            0.759,
            0.859,
            0.868
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.729,
                0.742,
                0.753,
                0.756
              ],
              "content": "(a)"
            },
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.727,
                0.873,
                0.752,
                0.889
              ],
              "content": "(b)"
            },
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.598,
                0.891,
                0.891,
                0.924
              ],
              "content": "Fig. 11.5: Viewing candle flame through (a) a straight pipe (b) a bent pipe"
            }
          ],
